window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-033-9f50d10eda9045a6.json"]={sha256:"9f50d10eda9045a6eeec646a9f0f6804aefae07f7029c26d6783e7b9f509d265",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-9c109e86a221b521","url":"https://docs.daos.io/v3.0/overview/data_integrity/","title":"DAOS data integrity","titleEn":"DAOS data integrity","publisher":"DAOS project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-033","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-033","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-034","referenceUrls":["https://docs.daos.io/master/overview/transaction/"],"title":"DAOS snapshots：保留視圖與版本回收界線","titleEn":"DAOS snapshots: retained views and version-reclamation boundaries","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付區間交集、零長度測例、checksum 狀態與 2/1 分塊結果；不聲稱實際 DAOS I/O 次數；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver interval intersections, zero-length tests, checksum states and the 2/1 chunk results. Explicitly avoid presenting the arithmetic as a measured DAOS I/O operation count. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 key、epoch、version_id、size 表與保留視圖集合；輸出 view_to_version、unique_versions 和候選回收三表。","differenceEn":"Build key, epoch, version identity and size records plus the retained-view set. Emit view-to-version mappings, unique referenced versions and candidate reclamation lists as separately reviewable artifacts.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["非空區間 [o,o+L) 觸碰區塊數為 ceil((o+L)/C)-floor(o/C)；零長度要獨立回傳零；checksum chunk 為 1024 B、更新長度 1024 B；名義起點 512 B，變更對齊為 0；名義式 ceil((512+1024)/1024)-floor(512/1024) = 2 checksum chunks touched；變更式 ceil((0+1024)/1024)-floor(0/1024) = 1 checksum chunks touched。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","每個保留視圖對每個鍵選不晚於 epoch 的最新版本，再對版本識別碼取聯集計容量；沒有引用的版本才是此模型候選；單鍵三版本：epoch 1 為 4 MiB、epoch 2 為 8、epoch 3 為 4；名義保留快照 1、2 與最新 3，變更移除快照 1；名義式 4+8+4 = 16 MiB referenced；變更式 8+4 = 12 MiB referenced。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For a nonempty interval [o,o+L), touched chunks equal ceiling((o+L)/C) minus floor(o/C). Handle zero length separately, since the nonempty formula can miscount an unaligned empty interval. Use 1024-byte checksum chunks and a 1024-byte update. Starting offset changes from 512 bytes to zero, while payload length and logical contents remain fixed. Nominal ceil((512+1024)/1024)-floor(512/1024) = 2 checksum chunks touched; changed ceil((0+1024)/1024)-floor(0/1024) = 1 checksum chunks touched. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","For each retained view and key, select the latest version not newer than its epoch. Sum the union of referenced version identities; unreferenced versions are reclamation candidates only within this simplified model. One key has versions of 4 MiB at epoch 1, 8 MiB at epoch 2 and 4 MiB at epoch 3. Retain snapshots 1 and 2 plus latest view 3, then remove snapshot 1 only. Nominal 4+8+4 = 16 MiB referenced; changed 8+4 = 12 MiB referenced. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-043","referenceUrls":["https://www.opencompute.org/documents/oai-system-liquid-cooling-guidelines-in-ocp-template-mar-3-2023-update-pdf"],"title":"OCP 歧管：平行冷卻支路的阻力不均","titleEn":"OCP manifolds: resistance imbalance in parallel cooling branches","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付區間交集、零長度測例、checksum 狀態與 2/1 分塊結果；不聲稱實際 DAOS I/O 次數；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver interval intersections, zero-length tests, checksum states and the 2/1 chunk results. Explicitly avoid presenting the arithmetic as a measured DAOS I/O operation count. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 branch_id、K、pressure、flow 與最低流量；總表之外必須輸出每支路合格判定。","differenceEn":"Build branch identity, resistance, pressure, flow and minimum-flow fields. Emit branch-level acceptance alongside the total so a healthy first branch cannot conceal a starved second branch.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["非空區間 [o,o+L) 觸碰區塊數為 ceil((o+L)/C)-floor(o/C)；零長度要獨立回傳零；checksum chunk 為 1024 B、更新長度 1024 B；名義起點 512 B，變更對齊為 0；名義式 ceil((512+1024)/1024)-floor(512/1024) = 2 checksum chunks touched；變更式 ceil((0+1024)/1024)-floor(0/1024) = 1 checksum chunks touched。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","各支路 q_i=sqrt(H/K_i)，總流量為各支路相加；此式假設固定共同壓差且互連歧管損失忽略；共同壓差 16 kPa；K1=1，K2 名義 4、變更 9，K 單位 kPa/(L/min)²；名義式 sqrt(16/1)+sqrt(16/4) = 6 L/min total；變更式 sqrt(16/1)+sqrt(16/9) = 5.33333333333 L/min total。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For a nonempty interval [o,o+L), touched chunks equal ceiling((o+L)/C) minus floor(o/C). Handle zero length separately, since the nonempty formula can miscount an unaligned empty interval. Use 1024-byte checksum chunks and a 1024-byte update. Starting offset changes from 512 bytes to zero, while payload length and logical contents remain fixed. Nominal ceil((512+1024)/1024)-floor(512/1024) = 2 checksum chunks touched; changed ceil((0+1024)/1024)-floor(0/1024) = 1 checksum chunks touched. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Each branch has q_i=sqrt(H/K_i), and total flow is their sum. Assume fixed common head and negligible manifold losses; do not add parallel resistances as if the branches were in series. Use common head 16 kPa, K1=1 and K2 changing from 4 to 9 in kPa/(L/min)². The primary branch remains unchanged while the second becomes more restrictive. Nominal sqrt(16/1)+sqrt(16/4) = 6 L/min total; changed sqrt(16/1)+sqrt(16/9) = 5.33333333333 L/min total. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-c359e652f7fedc4a","url":"https://docs.daos.io/master/overview/transaction/","title":"DAOS transaction model","titleEn":"DAOS transaction model","publisher":"DAOS project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-84367333215d0635","url":"https://www.opencompute.org/documents/oai-system-liquid-cooling-guidelines-in-ocp-template-mar-3-2023-update-pdf","title":"OAI System Liquid Cooling Guidelines","titleEn":"OAI System Liquid Cooling Guidelines","publisher":"Open Compute Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
